{"unit_id":"tag:094C:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。假设\n<MATH_0002> 的每个对象（object）都有由拟紧（quasi-compact）对象（objects）组成的覆盖（covering）。则\n<MATH_0003> 的每个紧（compact）对象（object）都是 <MATH_0004> 中\n一个有限（finite）复形（complex）的直和因子（direct summand），其各项为\n形如 <MATH_0006> 的 <MATH_0005>-模（modules）的有限（finite）直和（direct sums），\n其中 <MATH_0007> 是 <MATH_0008> 的拟紧（quasi-compact）对象（object）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"compact","target_term":"紧"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"direct summand","target_term":"直和因子"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"direct sums","target_term":"直和"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"基"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"位点及导出范畴"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"覆盖对象"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"生成性"},{"source_term":"compact","target_term":"紧","context":"导出对象"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"复形及直和"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"结论"},{"source_term":"direct summand","target_term":"直和因子","context":"结论"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"生成项"},{"source_term":"direct sums","target_term":"直和","context":"复形各项"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:094C:proof","translation":"应用引理 <REF_0001>，\n其中 <MATH_0001> 为形如 <MATH_0002> 且 <MATH_0003>\n拟紧（quasi-compact）的模（modules）的集（set）。假设 (1) 由\n位点上的模（Modules on Sites），引理 <REF_0002>\n以及每个 <MATH_0004> 都可由拟紧（quasi-compact）\n对象（objects）覆盖的假设给出。假设 (2) 由\n<MATH_0005>\n得到，它由\n位点（Sites），引理 <REF_0003> 与直和（direct sums）交换（commutes）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"direct sums","target_term":"直和"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"生成对象"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"生成集"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集","context":"生成集"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模","context":"章节引用"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"覆盖输入"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点","context":"章节引用"},{"source_term":"direct sums","target_term":"直和","context":"函子交换性"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"截面函子"}],"notes":[]}
